Package: cyberops
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CYBEROPS Contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/benglish2007/CYBEROPS
Depends: apt, bash (>= 5), coreutils, file, findutils, gawk, grep, hostname, iproute2, procps, sed, sudo, systemd, util-linux
Suggests: clamav, curl, docker.io, figlet, htop, lm-sensors, lolcat, macchanger, nmap, rkhunter, ufw, wavemon
Description: modular Linux operations console
 CYBEROPS is a menu-driven administration and security toolkit for supported
 Ubuntu and Debian systems. It combines guarded system, network, Docker, VPN,
 security, and removable-media workflows with read-only command channels.
